                <pb facs="0916" n="826" sameAs="frus:frus1920v02/pg826"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.3831/2a suppl: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Haiti</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Belden</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-03-29T12:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 29,
                                1920—noon</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>32. Department’s March 9, 3 p.m.</p>
                <p>Has Haitian Government issued <hi rendition="#italic">arrêté</hi> carrying out
                    provisions of the Contract of the Retrait? Memoranda of Minister of Finance on
                    this subject have been considered by Financial Advisor. Department’s March 9, 3
                    p.m. is answer thereto.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
